mod backend.compiler.expressions.operators;

/**
 * THE BUILT-IN OPERATIONS THAT NEED NO OVERLOAD RESOLUTION
 *
 * The files of this package (module `backend.compiler.expressions.operators`):
 *
 *      operators.sharp             this front door
 *      cast_expression.sharp       value as type
 *      is_expression.sharp         value is type
 *      not_null_expression.sharp   value!!
 *      elvis_expression.sharp      value ?: fallback
 *      ternary_expression.sharp    condition ? a : b
 *      sizeof_expression.sharp     sizeof(value)
 *
 * Arithmetic, comparison, `!`, `++` and assignment may run a function the
 * programmer wrote (`operator+`): they are expressions/arithmetic and
 * expressions/assignment.
 *
 * This file is the package's front door: it only says what is where.
 */
